  "reasoning": "The defendant organized a scheme that required participants to invest money and recruit others, promising returns based on the number of recruits. This is a classic pyramid (multi-level marketing) operation, which under Chinese criminal law constitutes the crime of organizing and leading a pyramid scheme (组织、领导传销活动罪). No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so a single charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]组织、领导传销活动罪<eoa>"
